_olex2_refinement_description
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All C(H,H) groups, All N(H,H,H) groups
2. Restrained distances
 F1-C6
 1.35 with sigma of 0.005
3.a Secondary CH2 refined with riding coordinates:
 C1(H1D,H1E), C2(H2A,H2B)
3.b Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 C7(H7), C5(H5), C4(H4), C8(H8)
3.c Fitted hexagon refined as free rotating group:
 C7(C6,C5,C4,C3,C8)
3.d Idealised Me refined as rotating group:
 N1(H1A,H1B,H1C)
